# "An instant or sorcery spell": Impolite Entrance is a sorcery that targets Bot1's Llanowar Elves, so the Leyline copies it. The Elves gain
# trample and haste either way, and Bot1 draws a card from the spell and one from its copy.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Resonance
Forest
Mountain
Mountain
Llanowar Elves
Impolite Entrance
Island
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Impolite Entrance.Cast(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Keywords = Haste; Trample
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Impolite Entrance
